{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>銅鑼灣有連鎖電器舖懷疑被盜竊，損失約188萬元貨物。</p><p></p><p>事發在時代廣場一間店舖，警方周三晚上近7時，接獲店舖負責人報案，指有61部相機，及55個相機鏡頭懷疑被盜去，總值約188萬元。警方正追捕一名年約40歲男子。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FORTRESS-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vPUNFKgU9d1795107497.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據了解涉事店舖是豐澤電器，涉案男子是店舖經理，懷疑他兩個月內偷走涉案物品，周三起失聯。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:01:44.697741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:37:42.032579+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T17:54:59.704697+00:00","content_hash":"a19083297b2d29e62116bbbc3033493ad4996bce8424cdcf9e85bd55e71e7fe6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:01:44.697741+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}